; Frozen HL4a archive (serial_host_pilot.md, SP5). The HL4a serial Cyclesim suite for
; the composed Host_link (host_link_migration.md) and the SP2 serial monitor suite, moved
; here verbatim from test/host_link/. SP5 ports every test to ../../endpoint/, the
; authoritative Host_link-level suite; this copy keeps building and running unchanged as
; a frozen oracle. Never edit or reformat it (../.ocamlformat-ignore). Dropping it from
; the build is a separate owner decision.
;
; The real loader is driven through its serial pins with the host_link_wire codec, and a
; test-only core stub answers its Control_port. The environment is the endpoint fixture
; in endpoint/ (protemu_host_link_endpoint); hardware_loader_testbench.ml is its
; compatibility shim. This is the acceptance baseline for the HL4b extractions. It
; supplements, and never replaces, the independent emitted-RTL peer in
; tinytapeout/test/p3_loader_tb.v.

